<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bowater featured stock.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bowater featured stock.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it named paper company Bowater Inc as its featured stock of the week.</p>
<p>-- It rates the stock a buy.</p>
<p>-- The shares were off 1/4 at 39-1/2.</p>
</text>
